  "description": "The Hiboy TITAN Pro is a flagship dual-drive off-road electric scooter built for riders who want strong performance, confident control, and long-range capability. It reaches up to 33 MPH, climbs up to 35% inclines, and offers up to 80 miles of range.\nFor riders who want the most capable setup, an optional Dual BOSCH in-hub motor version is available, delivering up to 2400W combined peak power for torque-forward acceleration and smoother, more controllable performance—especially on rough terrain. A standard motor version is also available.\nWith a reinforced 6061 aluminum frame, 10-inch gel-filled tires, dual hydraulic brakes, and a dual suspension system, the TITAN Pro is designed to ride stable and comfortable across off-road trails, longer rides, and everyday commutes.",
